```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Bob
    participant NIP04Service
    participant KeyMgmt
    participant SpamCheck
    participant ECDH
    participant AES256
    participant Cache

    Note over Bob,Cache: Encrypted DM Decryption Flow

    Bob->>NIP04Service: Receive DM event (kind 4)

    NIP04Service->>SpamCheck: checkSpamProtection(senderPubkey, event)

    alt Blocked or Rate Limited
        SpamCheck-->>NIP04Service: REJECTED
        NIP04Service-->>Bob: Message blocked
    else Allowed
        SpamCheck-->>NIP04Service: ALLOWED

        NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Validate encrypted format
        Note over NIP04Service: Check for ?iv= separator

        NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Parse encrypted content
        Note over NIP04Service: Split ciphertext and IV

        NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Base64 decode ciphertext and IV

        NIP04Service->>KeyMgmt: getPrivateKey()
        KeyMgmt-->>NIP04Service: privateKey

        NIP04Service->>ECDH: deriveSharedSecret(privateKey, senderPubkey)
        Note over ECDH: secp256k1 ECDH
        ECDH-->>NIP04Service: sharedSecret (32 bytes)

        NIP04Service->>AES256: decrypt(ciphertext, sharedSecret, IV)
        Note over AES256: AES-256-CBC
        AES256-->>NIP04Service: plaintext

        NIP04Service->>Cache: cacheDecryptedMessage(messageId, message, plaintext)
        Cache-->>NIP04Service: Cached

        NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: addMessageToThread(message)
        NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Update unread count

        NIP04Service-->>Bob: Decrypted message

        Bob->>NIP04Service: createReadReceipt(messageId, senderPubkey)
        NIP04Service-->>Bob: readReceiptEvent (kind 1515)
    end

    Note over Bob,Cache: Security: Rate limit + Spam + Validation
